        "# ML-07 — Baseline Action Score and Top-20 Review\n",
        "\n",
        "[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/janaadarwish/flyrank-ml-internship/blob/main/work/notebooks/w04_baseline_score.ipynb?flush_cache=true)\n",
        "\n",
